1
00:00:00,369 --> 00:00:02,659
(Howard:)Unless she's willing to jump off
a moving train...

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:06,460
(Howard:)...tuck and roll down the side of a hill,
she will eventually succumb...

3
00:00:06,625 --> 00:00:11,085
(Howard:)...to the acquired taste
that is Howard Wolowitz.

4
00:00:13,966 --> 00:00:15,796
(Leonard:)My money's on tuck and roll.

5
00:00:16,677 --> 00:00:17,757
(Sheldon:)I'm confused.

6
00:00:17,928 --> 00:00:22,638
(Sheldon:)I thought you were involved in some sort of
socially intimate pairing with Leslie Winkle.

7
00:00:22,808 --> 00:00:26,478
(Howard:)- Let me explain to you how this works.
- All right.

8
00:00:26,645 --> 00:00:29,145
(Sheldon:)- That's Summer Glau.
- Yes?

9
00:00:29,982 --> 00:00:31,362
(Howard:)That's it.

10
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:33,439
(Raj:)Hang on a sec.

11
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:36,820
(Raj:)- Why do you get first crack at her?
- Uh, well, let's see. Couple reasons.

12
00:00:36,989 --> 00:00:38,779
(Howard:)One, I saw her first.

13
00:00:38,949 --> 00:00:40,029
(Raj:)No, you didn't. I did.

14
00:00:40,868 --> 00:00:43,538
(Howard:)Fair enough. But then let me move on
to number two.

15
00:00:43,704 --> 00:00:47,294
(Howard:)Unlike you, I can actually talk to women
when I'm sober.

16
00:00:47,458 --> 00:00:51,548
(Raj:)You fail to take into account
that even mute, I am foreign and exotic...

17
00:00:51,712 --> 00:00:55,552
(Raj:)...while you, on the other hand,
are frail and pasty.

18
00:00:56,717 --> 00:00:58,547
(Howard:)Well, you know the old saying.

